OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARallies take place in Portadown
OL,4,Aover Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at an event on the Garvaghy
OL,7,FRoad, First Minister and Sinn Fein vice
OL,8,Fpresident Michelle O'Neill said she
OL,9,Fheard the Northern Ireland Secretary
OL,10,FSir Chris Bryant "talk about being
OL,11,Fbetween a rock and a hard place",
OL,12,Fadding she has "never heard such
OL,13,Fnonsense, this is between right and
OL,14,Fwrong".
OL,16,FSpeaking at Drumcree church, Democratic
OL,17,FUnionist Party (DUP) MP Carla Lockhart
OL,18,Frepeated calls for PSNI Chief Constable
OL,19,FJon Boutcher and his officers to "do
OL,20,Ftheir job" and facilitate the parade,
OL,21,Fdescribing the current impasse as "mob
OL,22,Frule".
